"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-05T15:50:58Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T15:50:58Z","body":"Cherry-picked for 4.6.1.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3854523959/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3928185627","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115124#issuecomment-3928185627","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115124","id":3928185627,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qI1sb","user":{"login":"Kiyuja","id":72861629,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODYxNjI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72861629?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kiyuja","html_url":"https://github.com/Kiyuja","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kiyuja/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kiyuja/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kiyuja/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kiyuja/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kiyuja/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kiyuja/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kiyuja/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kiyuja/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kiyuja/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-19T15:58:57Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T15:58:57Z","body":"Hey @blueskythlikesclouds. I know this is already long merged and maybe this isnt as closely related, but couldnt it make sense to temporally shuffle the sampling around? I think this is then called MFAA and the idea is to change the targeted x2 samples around every other frame. \r\nAFAIK when using x2, by default, algorithms try to select the pixels to its left and right border as samples. Whereas 4x just samples every \"border\" once. In theory, you can switch every frame to test either left-right or top-bottom.\r\nApparently if your framerate is at least 40 FPS you can get basically identical anti-aliasing to x4 at fairly low cost.\r\n\r\nShould I open an Issue for a feature like that? I didnt want to bother more than necessary and saw this as a good opportunity to mention it. Could be really useful for low end devices, especially phones, where sometimes even a stable 60FPS is tricky to achieve so it might help. I am not entirely sure whether this puts a band aid over the \"spikiness\" though.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3928185627/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3928222485","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115124#issuecomment-3928222485","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115124","id":3928222485,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qI-sV","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesc